{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An adult visual novel blending martial arts, passion, and redemption.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're Russell</strong> (name customisable) and were once a professional fighter, climbing the ranks and making a name for yourself. A humiliating loss shattered your career, sending everything spiralling out of control. Sponsors pulled their support, and opportunities disappeared overnight. With no clear direction, you drifted from one meaningless night to the next. When a couple of drunk fans pushed you too far at a bar, you snapped. By the time it was over, they were the ones left broken, and you were facing serious jail time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591090/extras/9f90e208e8b8fef2fb7afdb91f7a7bc1.avif?t=1760984005\" width=616 height=1039 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of prison, an unexpected deal gave you another option. A judge offered an alternative sentence: provide self-defense training to women for free. It wasn\u2019t what you wanted, but it kept you out of a cell. With no other choice, you accepted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591090/extras/17fb3ad45d2e951a0311971429cc3039.avif?t=1760984005\" width=646 height=1090 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your first trainee, Naomi, already has some martial arts experience. She knows the techniques but struggles with confidence. At first, the training is just a requirement to fulfil, but as you work together, you see potential in her. With the right guidance, she could become a serious competitor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591090/extras/a38f879ff01c1e9d08b1859650551490.avif?t=1760984005\" width=616 height=1039 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desperate for a way to fix everything, you come up with a plan. Naomi has skill, and professional fighting pays well. If she competes, she can earn real money. She needs a manager, and with your experience, you are the right person for the job. Training intensifies as you push her to reach her limits, sharpening both her technique and her mindset. She is strong, but the road to becoming a true fighter is brutal. Every day brings new challenges, both inside and outside the ring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591090/extras/0d07606dc5a0eeaea65591cd514c4919.avif?t=1760984005\" width=616 height=1039 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spending so much time together strengthens your bond with Naomi. Long hours, shared struggles, and physical training sessions create an undeniable closeness. The connection between you deepens, and attraction grows. The choices you make will shape your relationship and define how everything unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Martial arts is more than just fighting. It is discipline, strategy, and mental resilience. Everything you do will influence the story, from how you train Naomi to how you deal with the people from your past. The journey ahead is intense, but the path forward is yours to decide.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Naomi\u2019s First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591090/4609daec40baa27581d1d05ab962e2a62abd46d4.jpg"},{"name":"No More Mr. Nice Guy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591090/97cfe52f34cb8027cc6efa95a91ba170163411be.jpg"},{"name":"Blooded and Unbroken","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591090/07de2a1d8e4746b7078ba5abbd5747fb5deef77c.jpg"},{"name":"No Quarter Given","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591090/e1936dc781c748107d1e0dc71ca91de98ccf40d9.jpg"},{"name":"Silent Execution","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591090/3a1ed6d5d3605c41e5867fb65698a7c037dbf818.jpg"},{"name":"The Final Lesson","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591090/d43d2c73736e85b4aa9813602453f696f0a9c551.jpg"},{"name":"First and Last Mistake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591090/05b238a0d48531717b4eff73a713e19580dbe913.jpg"},{"name":"Broken Beyond Repair","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591090/d004b41cae31ec847ae6f0af7ab0f773842b6d86.jpg"},{"name":"Eviscerated Legacy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591090/5e4d4ee71534e75da4367638c7987e395179286d.jpg"},{"name":"Forgotten in the Gore","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591090/81352455dfc6a41a1ef7f8813c11b1e5dc51c303.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591090?t=1760984005","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591090?t=1760984005","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591090/43986046799df2b32dfc1f869808551f77f0ab2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760984005","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591090/43986046799df2b32dfc1f869808551f77f0ab2e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760984005","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Teach Me Master is an adult visual novel intended only for mature audiences.\r\n\r\nThe game contains:\r\n\r\n* Explicit depictions of sexual acts (both text and visuals).\r\n* Violent altercations\r\n* Frequent use of strong adult language"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An adult visual novel blending martial arts, passion, and redemption.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're Russell</strong> (name customisable) and were once a professional fighter, climbing the ranks and making a name for yourself. A humiliating loss shattered your career, sending everything spiralling out of control. Sponsors pulled their support, and opportunities disappeared overnight. With no clear direction, you drifted from one meaningless night to the next. When a couple of drunk fans pushed you too far at a bar, you snapped. By the time it was over, they were the ones left broken, and you were facing serious jail time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591090/extras/9f90e208e8b8fef2fb7afdb91f7a7bc1.avif?t=1760984005\" width=616 height=1039 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of prison, an unexpected deal gave you another option. A judge offered an alternative sentence: provide self-defense training to women for free. It wasn\u2019t what you wanted, but it kept you out of a cell. With no other choice, you accepted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591090/extras/17fb3ad45d2e951a0311971429cc3039.avif?t=1760984005\" width=646 height=1090 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your first trainee, Naomi, already has some martial arts experience. She knows the techniques but struggles with confidence. At first, the training is just a requirement to fulfil, but as you work together, you see potential in her. With the right guidance, she could become a serious competitor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591090/extras/a38f879ff01c1e9d08b1859650551490.avif?t=1760984005\" width=616 height=1039 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desperate for a way to fix everything, you come up with a plan. Naomi has skill, and professional fighting pays well. If she competes, she can earn real money. She needs a manager, and with your experience, you are the right person for the job. Training intensifies as you push her to reach her limits, sharpening both her technique and her mindset. She is strong, but the road to becoming a true fighter is brutal. Every day brings new challenges, both inside and outside the ring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591090/extras/0d07606dc5a0eeaea65591cd514c4919.avif?t=1760984005\" width=616 height=1039 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spending so much time together strengthens your bond with Naomi. Long hours, shared struggles, and physical training sessions create an undeniable closeness. The connection between you deepens, and attraction grows. The choices you make will shape your relationship and define how everything unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Martial arts is more than just fighting. It is discipline, strategy, and mental resilience. Everything you do will influence the story, from how you train Naomi to how you deal with the people from your past. The journey ahead is intense, but the path forward is yours to decide.</p>","developers":["JellyFluff Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor